{
 "_comment": "Clock-gating and logic-depth units for DI's DCU RTL (tools/check-cg.py, tools/check-ngd.py; docs/rtl-coding-style.md, 'Local clock gating' and 'Logic depth'; the partition is MA's Phase 2 slice 1, DCU tab rev 82). Each bench is the module's value-model bench (test/dcu/*_tb.cpp) in its --cg mode, built by test/dcu/cg-build.sh at the unit's parameters: idle is reset and then no work, medium work on about a third of the cycles, high work nearly every cycle. dcu_cap is one request slot's ccv_miu_dcu_req capture at its one size; dcu_btag is bank 0's tag RFs and compare at full size (64 sets of 8 ways), which is also the RF's smallest legal size; dcu_bctl is bank 0's control (arbitration, queue, fold table, PLRU) at full size; dcu_mshr is bank 0's miss buffers (MA-34: one instance a bank, 16 entries) and dcu_mpick the one cross-bank pick of the retry and the MLC request.",
